#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KButtonGroup, kcfg_Theme)
#: themeui.ui:16
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This dialog allows you to choose the theme that will be displayed when you "
"turn a card. In colors, you will have to match cards that are the same "
"color; the house theme consists of pictures of objects you can find in a "
"house; opposites are geometrical figures that match with opposite colors."
msgstr ""
"Hier kannst Du de Koortensetten ehr Mustern utsöken. Wenn Du dat Muster "
"\"Klören\" bruukst, muttst Du all Koorten mit de sülve Klöör finnen un "
"toornen, \"Huus\" bargt Biller vun DIngen binnen en Huus, un \"Gegendeel\" "
"sünd geometersch Figuren, de op gegenricht Klören passt."

